  <h2>Cambodian food in Los Angeles</h2>
  <p>LA County is home to one of the largest Cambodian communities outside Cambodia, centered in Long Beach. Sam, our co-owner, moved there in 2011. Today we bring Cambodian street BBQ to markets and events all over the city.</p>
  <p>Our food is built on kreung. We marinate every meat in it, grill it over fire, and serve it with rice, coconut corn, pickled vegetables and house sauces. Heat lives in the sauces, so everyone can eat together.</p>

